information:
Syntax
r = Matrices.frobeniusNorm(A);
Description
This function computes the Frobenius norm of a general real matrix A, i.e., the square root of the sum of the squares of all elements.
Example
A = [1, 2;
2, 1];
r = frobeniusNorm(A);
